		(at 56.4 7.2)
		(descr "CEC sense-return provision pad, DNP -- iteration-5 replacement for the retired CEC_CONN_2x5 signal stub's 6 reserved positions (blade-fit memo addendum 5): a bare 2.0x2.5mm SMD solder pad, no connector body, hand-solder target only, clearly silk-labelled (SR1..SR6 on the 24-pin daughterboard). Carries NO net today -- this changes the OQ-88 sense-return PROVISION FORM only; the decision (whether/when/granularity) remains open and the owner's. PCB-only mechanical footprint (board_only, excluded from BOM/pos), same convention as mounting holes.")
